#: npc/quests/quests_brasilis.txt#104 (mes)
- "[Candy Maker]"
+ "[Doceira]"
#: npc/quests/quests_brasilis.txt#105 (mes)
- "Guarana is a really special berry raised in a specific area, it relieves physical fatigue, and gives power to the body. It even detoxes waste from the body."
+ "O guaraná é uma fruta muito especial, criada só por aqui. Alivia o cansaço do corpo, dá força e ainda ajuda a limpar o organismo."
#: npc/quests/quests_brasilis.txt#106 (mes)
- "[Candy Maker]"
+ "[Doceira]"
#: npc/quests/quests_brasilis.txt#107 (mes)
- "I used to sell the candy made of it back in the day."
+ "Antigamente eu vendia bala feita dele."
#: npc/quests/quests_brasilis.txt#108 (mes)
- "I got a prize sometimes every year in the <annual best product contest>. Those were the good 'ol days."
+ "Ganhei prêmio quase todo ano no <concurso do melhor produto do ano>. Que tempos bons."
#: npc/quests/quests_brasilis.txt#109 (mes)
- "[Candy Maker]"
+ "[Doceira]"
#: npc/quests/quests_brasilis.txt#110 (mes)
- "Since then, the output of that fruit has reduced and the price has gone up so now candy ingredients were changed to coconuts or other tropical fruits instead. I miss the guarana candy."
+ "De lá para cá a colheita da fruta caiu, o preço subiu, e a bala passou a ser feita de coco e de outras frutas tropicais. Sinto falta da bala de guaraná."
#: npc/quests/quests_brasilis.txt#111 (select)
- "How can I taste this guarana candy?:End conversation."
+ "Como faço para provar essa bala de guaraná?:Encerrar a conversa."
#: npc/quests/quests_brasilis.txt#112 (mes)
- "[Candy Maker]"
+ "[Doceira]"
#: npc/quests/quests_brasilis.txt#113 (mes)
- "Hmm? I already sold out of all my old supply."
+ "Hmm? Já vendi tudo o que tinha guardado."
#: npc/quests/quests_brasilis.txt#114 (mes)
- "[Candy Maker]"
+ "[Doceira]"
#: npc/quests/quests_brasilis.txt#115 (mes)
- "But if you can find some guarana, I can make it for you."
+ "Mas se você me arrumar guaraná, eu faço para você."
#: npc/quests/quests_brasilis.txt#116 (select)
- "How do I find guarana?:End conversation."
+ "Como eu encontro guaraná?:Encerrar a conversa."
#: npc/quests/quests_brasilis.txt#117 (mes)
- "[Candy Maker]"
+ "[Doceira]"
#: npc/quests/quests_brasilis.txt#118 (mes)
- "Will you find the guarana?? Hoooooh~"
+ "Você vai atrás do guaraná?? Rôôôô~"
#: npc/quests/quests_brasilis.txt#119 (mes)
- "[Candy Maker]"
+ "[Doceira]"
#: npc/quests/quests_brasilis.txt#120 (mes)
- "Can you find it?"
