#: npc/quests/quests_brasilis.txt#121 (mes)
- "It's probably very expensive."
+ "Deve ser caríssimo."
#: npc/quests/quests_brasilis.txt#122 (mes)
- "Trading isn't my thing. Let me think."
+ "Negociar não é comigo. Deixa eu pensar."
#: npc/quests/quests_brasilis.txt#123 (mes)
- "[Candy Maker]"
+ "[Doceira]"
#: npc/quests/quests_brasilis.txt#124 (mes)
- "Let me introduce you to someone with whom I used to do guarana business with."
+ "Vou lhe apresentar uma pessoa com quem eu fazia negócio de guaraná."
#: npc/quests/quests_brasilis.txt#125 (mes)
- "He might still be dealing it."
+ "Pode ser que ainda mexa com isso."
#: npc/quests/quests_brasilis.txt#126 (mes)
- "[Candy Maker]"
+ "[Doceira]"
#: npc/quests/quests_brasilis.txt#127 (mes)
- "His name is Cherto."
+ "O nome dele é Paulão."
#: npc/quests/quests_brasilis.txt#128 (mes)
- "If you can't find him in the city, go to museum."
+ "Se não achar ele na cidade, vá até o museu."
#: npc/quests/quests_brasilis.txt#129 (mes)
- "He's a vain person so he likes to act big."
+ "É um homem vaidoso, gosta de se achar."
#: npc/quests/quests_brasilis.txt#130 (mes)
- "He's probably wandering in the museum trying to show off to someone for sure."
+ "Deve estar rondando o museu tentando se exibir para alguém, isso é certo."
#: npc/quests/quests_brasilis.txt#131 (mes)
- "[Candy Maker]"
+ "[Doceira]"
#: npc/quests/quests_brasilis.txt#132 (mes)
- "Don't you want to try the guarana candy?"
+ "Não quer provar a bala de guaraná?"
#: npc/quests/quests_brasilis.txt#133 (mes)
- "[Candy Maker]"
+ "[Doceira]"
#: npc/quests/quests_brasilis.txt#134 (mes)
- "Those were the good 'ole days..."
+ "Aqueles tempos é que eram bons..."
#: npc/quests/quests_brasilis.txt#135 (mes)
- "[Candy Maker]"
+ "[Doceira]"
#: npc/quests/quests_brasilis.txt#136 (mes)
- "If you want to get the guarana, find Cherto."
+ "Se quiser o guaraná, procure o Paulão."
#: npc/quests/quests_brasilis.txt#137 (mes)
- "Maybe he will be in the museum."
+ "Talvez ele esteja no museu."
#: npc/quests/quests_brasilis.txt#138 (mes)
- "- The guarana that I had has disappeared. -"
+ "- O guaraná que eu tinha desapareceu. -"
#: npc/quests/quests_brasilis.txt#139 (mes)
- "[Candy Maker]"
+ "[Doceira]"
#: npc/quests/quests_brasilis.txt#140 (mes)
- "Did you get the guarana?"
+ "Conseguiu o guaraná?"
