- "[Candy Maker]"
+ "[Doceira]"
#: npc/quests/quests_brasilis.txt#143 (mes)
- "Wow! You have special talent."
+ "Uau! Você tem um talento e tanto."
#: npc/quests/quests_brasilis.txt#144 (mes)
- "It's the best thing I have ever seen so far. Cool~!"
