- "[Candy Maker]"
+ "[Doceira]"
#: npc/quests/quests_brasilis.txt#156 (mes)
- "Since you helped me, guarana supply has been steadily rising."
+ "Depois que você me ajudou, o guaraná voltou a aparecer aos poucos."
#: npc/quests/quests_brasilis.txt#157 (mes)
- "So, naturally I'm back to making guarana candy."
+ "E aí, naturalmente, voltei a fazer bala de guaraná."
#: npc/quests/quests_brasilis.txt#158 (mes)
- "[Candy Maker]"
+ "[Doceira]"
#: npc/quests/quests_brasilis.txt#159 (mes)
- "What about it? Wanna buy some?"
