#: npc/quests/quests_brasilis.txt#483 (mes)
- "[Karmen]"
+ "[Carmen]"
#: npc/quests/quests_brasilis.txt#484 (mes)
- "The plants here have robust frames and are clear and colorful."
+ "As plantas daqui têm caule robusto e são nítidas e coloridas."
#: npc/quests/quests_brasilis.txt#485 (mes)
- "Here the plants are really huge and we can feel their presence."
+ "Aqui as plantas são enormes, dá para sentir a presença delas."
#: npc/quests/quests_brasilis.txt#486 (mes)
- "[Karmen]"
+ "[Carmen]"
#: npc/quests/quests_brasilis.txt#487 (mes)
- "One of them, a Water Lily, is a really gorgeous and unique plant."
+ "Uma delas, a Vitória-Régia, é uma planta esplêndida e única."
#: npc/quests/quests_brasilis.txt#488 (mes)
- "This flower is quite sensitive so it doesn't bloom everywhere."
+ "Essa flor é bem sensível, então não desabrocha em qualquer lugar."
