- "[Marta]"
+ "[Jurema]"
#: npc/quests/quests_brasilis.txt#587 (mes)
- "Although her parents tried to prevent her, she still went to the forest to meet the moon every night."
+ "Mesmo com os pais tentando impedir, ela ia à floresta todas as noites para encontrar a lua."
#: npc/quests/quests_brasilis.txt#588 (mes)
- "Sadly, even with all of her effort, the moon didn't show any reaction to her."
+ "Infelizmente, apesar de todo o esforço dela, a lua não deu sinal nenhum."
