- "[Marta]"
+ "[Jurema]"
#: npc/quests/quests_brasilis.txt#590 (mes)
- "One day she also went to the top of the mountain to be closer to him. She decided to take a rest for a while around the lake."
+ "Um dia ela subiu até o alto da montanha para ficar mais perto dele. E resolveu descansar um pouco à beira do lago."
