#: npc/quests/quests_brasilis.txt#1419 (mes)
- "purification potion..."
+ "Poção Puri..."
#: npc/quests/quests_brasilis.txt#1420 (mes)
- "[Anori]"
+ "[Anori]"
#: npc/quests/quests_brasilis.txt#1421 (mes)
- "Maybe because of the purification potion..."
+ "Talvez por causa da Poção Puri..."
#: npc/quests/quests_brasilis.txt#1422 (mes)
