- "[Anori]"
+ "[Anori]"
#: npc/quests/quests_brasilis.txt#1429 (mes)
- "This, ah..."
+ "Isto, ah..."
#: npc/quests/quests_brasilis.txt#1430 (mes)
- "There is no other way."
+ "Não há outro jeito."
