+ "[Anori]"
#: npc/quests/quests_brasilis.txt#1448 (mes)
- "There are some people I haven't seen before around here."
+ "Tem gente por aqui que eu nunca vi antes."
#: npc/quests/quests_brasilis.txt#1449 (mes)
- "It's a good sign..."
+ "É um bom sinal..."
#: npc/quests/quests_brasilis.txt#1450 (mes)
- "[Anori]"
+ "[Anori]"
#: npc/quests/quests_brasilis.txt#1451 (mes)
- "Hey you..."
+ "Ei, você..."
#: npc/quests/quests_brasilis.txt#1452 (mes)
